config VIDEO_SW_H264ENC
	bool "Software H.264 encoder"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_VIDEO_SW_H264ENC_ENABLED
	depends on VIDEO_ENCODER_H264
	help
	  Enable a minimal software H.264 encoder, for testing purposes.
	  It produces valid Constrained Baseline streams made of uncompressed
	  (I_PCM) and skipped macroblocks only, so the output is large. It is
	  meant to exercise video encoder APIs on any platform, including
	  native_sim, and not for production use.
